==============================================================================
degree-2 SoS bound vs degree-2 moment-LP bound (does SDP beat LP? -> collapse)
==============================================================================
 Univariate scheme on N in {0..6}: SoS-Hankel-PSD == LP-simplex realizability.
 So degree-2 SoS bound should EQUAL the L=3 (S_0,S_1,S_2) moment-LP bound.

  k=8 consec : moment-LP(deg2)=0.496372  SoS(deg2)=0.496372  EQUAL? True  (opt-Hankel PSD lmin=8.25e-02)
